## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design an EU-resident analytics flow with data governance, simple serverless components, and cost awareness.

## Key Concepts
- EU residency and data sovereignty
- Event-driven ingestion with Azure Event Hubs
- Serverless processing with Azure Functions
- Per-tenant access control via Cosmos DB RLS
- BYOK using Azure Key Vault
- Data retention and purge workflows
- DR planning and cost optimization

## Code Example
```javascript
module.exports = async function (context, eventHubMessages) {
  const { CosmosClient } = require('@azure/cosmos');
  const client = new CosmosClient(process.env.COSMOS_CONNECTION);
  const container = client.database('Analytics').container('TenantStats');
  for (const msg of eventHubMessages) {
    const payload = JSON.parse(msg.body);
    const item = {
      id: payload.id,
      tenantId: payload.tenantId,
      metric: payload.metric,
      value: payload.value,
      ts: new Date().toISOString()
    };
    await container.items.upsert(item);
  }
};
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you handle GDPR data deletion requests in this flow?
- What tests would you run to verify retention and DR requirements?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design federated analytics with strict data residency, cross-tenant privacy, and governance in Azure at scale. It also probes edge ingestion, lakehouse patterns, federated training orchestration, and cost/DR considerations.

## Key Concepts

- Federated learning with secure aggregation and differential privacy
- Edge MQTT ingress and regional Arc gateway roles
- Delta Lake partitioning by tenant and region on ADLS Gen2
- Centralized ML registry via Azure ML; governance via Purview and BYOK
- DR with paired regions; cost controls via autoscale and quotas

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo orchestration sketch (not executable)
async function federatedStep(tenant, data) {
  ingestMQTT(tenant, data);
  streamToDelta(tenant);
  triggerFederatedTraining(tenant);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you enforce tenant isolation in Delta Lake at scale?
- What monitoring would you put in place for federated model drift and privacy breaches?

